WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.420
The External Frameworks variable is
supported by the four load-bearing pillars

2
00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:05.140
of the European Code of Conduct.

3
00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:10.040
Principle 1 is reliability, the
requirement to ensure quality in research

4
00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:13.340
design, methodology, and the allocation of
resources.

5
00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:18.460
Principle 3 is respect, mandating regard
for colleagues, research

6
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:22.280
participants, societal impact, and
ecosystems.

7
00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:27.600
Principle 4 is accountability, requiring a
chain of responsibility from

8
00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:32.060
initial conceptualization through to final
publication and mentorship.

9
00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:37.840
Principle 2, Honesty, requires a closer
look at its application in real-world

10
00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:38.880
scenarios.
